@startuml
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam defaultFontColor black
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor black
    LifeLineBorderColor black
    ParticipantBorderColor black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantFontColor black
}

participant "Scheduler" as T
participant "GitHub Actions" as H
participant "Catalog Builder" as B
participant "GitHub API" as G
participant "GitHub Pages" as P

T -> H: Trigger refresh-catalog
H -> B: npm run build (build-catalog.mjs)
B -> G: fetch manifests + releases
G --> B: manifest + release data
B --> H: registry.json + catalog
H -> H: npm test
H -> P: upload + deploy
P --> T: Updated catalog
note over T: Runs on a schedule and on demand.
@enduml
